<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Three S.African gold mines issue cautionary.</title>
<headline>Three S.African gold mines issue cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Durban Roodepoort Deep Ltd, B uffelsfontein Gold Mines Ltd and Blyvooruitzicht Gold Mining Co Ltd said on Friday proposals were under consideration which could have a material effect on the price of their shares and options.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>No further details were given in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
